  <!-- What to Expect -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="community-layout">
        <div class="community-text">
          <h2>What to expect</h2>
          <p>Volunteering with KRBS is rewarding, challenging and sometimes intense. There are various roles including phone coordination and on-site rescue work. Whatever role you perform, you will be helping to protect the lives of koalas across Brisbane south.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">We are looking for people who are mentally prepared for emergencies, focused on teamwork, willing to learn, committed to the mission and passionate about koalas. For some of the on-site rescue roles, volunteers must also be physically capable of handling more strenuous activities. Prior experience is not required.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="community-image">
          <img src="website-images/Koala looking up tree.jpg" alt="Koala looking up into the canopy of a gum tree" loading="lazy">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Volunteer Roles -->
  <section class="section section--light">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Volunteer roles</h2>
      <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-light); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;">There's a place for everyone, whether you're on the front line or behind the scenes.</p>
      <div class="role-grid">
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 36px; color: var(--light-green); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block;">phone_in_talk</span>
          <h3>Phone coordinator</h3>
          <p>Respond to calls from the public 24/7 — choose your shift. Record details, organise a first responder to attend and liaise with the rescue lead.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 36px; color: var(--light-green); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block;">emergency</span>
          <h3>First responder</h3>
          <p>Be the first KRBS volunteer on scene. Talk with the member of the public, assess the situation, tag the location and brief the rescue lead.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 36px; color: var(--light-green); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block;">groups</span>
          <h3>Rescuer / rescue support</h3>
          <p>Rescue activities include spotting, netting, catching, directing the public and pole handling. Rescue supporters choose their level of activity.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 36px; color: var(--light-green); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block;">timer</span>
          <h3>Trap / tree sitter</h3>
          <p>Quietly monitor koalas in risky locations or those that need containing, in one or two hour blocks. Sometimes regular drive-by check-ins are needed instead.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 36px; color: var(--light-green); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block;">directions_car</span>
          <h3>Transporter</h3>
          <p>Drive a rescued koala to veterinary care or a safe release location. Requires your own vehicle and availability on a needs basis.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 36px; color: var(--light-green); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block;">admin_panel_settings</span>
          <h3>Administration</h3>
          <!-- TODO: placeholder role titles, Hilary to confirm final list with Michelle before this ships to a real review cycle -->
          <p>Sub-roles include membership coordinator, training organiser, RSPCA liaison officer, koala record keeper and sign maker.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 36px; color: var(--light-green); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block;">campaign</span>
          <h3>Community advocate</h3>
          <p>Spread awareness at events, contribute to social media and organise or assist at fundraisers. Help people care about koalas before a crisis hits.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

